pay
├── given a valid, active authorization
│   ├── when allowance exists
│   │   └── settles exact merchant amount, fee, replay state and metadata hash
│   └── when a valid permit is supplied
│       └── settles without a prior approval transaction
├── given caller or signed economic terms differ
│   └── reverts without moving funds or consuming replay state
├── given attempt or intent was already settled
│   └── reverts
├── given authorization is early, expired or malformed
│   └── reverts
└── given router is paused
    └── reverts; only owner can resume

administration
├── owner rotates treasury, signer and pause guardian
├── pause guardian can only pause
└── owner can rescue accidental tokens; normal settlement retains zero
